description: Never pause mid-task to ask for confirmation or permission
alwaysApply: true
---

# Task Completion Behavior

- NEVER stop mid-task to ask "should I continue?" or "do you want me to proceed?"
- NEVER summarize progress and wait for approval before continuing
- Complete the ENTIRE task from start to finish before responding
- Only message the user when the full job is 100% done
- If you hit an issue, handle it and keep going — do not stop to report minor blockers
- The user gave the instruction once — that is enough to complete the full job
